Attribution for item-wire.mjs
============================

The bounded array reader and SignedBigInt methods adapt protodef 1.19.0
src/datatypes/compiler-structures.js and src/datatypes/numeric.js.
The bounded holder-set reader adapts minecraft-protocol 1.68.0
src/datatypes/compiler-minecraft.js. The NBT compound reader adapts
prismarine-nbt 2.8.0 compiler-compound.js, requiring a terminator and preserving
prototype-like keys as own properties. Bounds and registry ID mapping are local
changes. Modified UTF-8 decoding is implemented locally for Java NBT strings.

The PC1.21.1 type descriptions are loaded from minecraft-data 3.117.0, cloned,
and corrected privately. The tests use independent byte fixtures based on the
generated Minecraft 1.21.1 stream-codec layouts. No Minecraft source is copied.

Runtime packages retain their own license obligations when distributed. The
licenses of copied/adapted portions follow verbatim. The prismarine-nbt npm
package has no LICENSE; its original MIT declaration/authorship metadata is
retained verbatim instead of inventing copyright attribution.


